{
  "__doc": "Registro de corridas de revisores con REPO y STORY (2026-08-25, Tema 2 del plan de controles apagables). El registro voluntario (gates.log check=advisors) sólo se escribe si alguien tipea el comando: 142 de sus 149 entradas históricas no tenían repo. El registro AUTOMÁTICO —los spawns reales que anota on-advisor-run.js— sí era confiable pero guardaba {ts, advisor, model} y nada más: 756 líneas medidas, CERO con repo, o sea que no podía contestar '¿corrieron los revisores de la story X?'. Estos casos fijan que cada spawn quede atribuido: por el marker de la sesión si lo hay, por la raíz de git del cwd si no.",
  "hooks": [
    {
      "hook": "on-advisor-run.js (atribución del registro)",
      "script": "${SKILLS}/skills/tycon-pipeline/scripts/on-advisor-run.js",
      "event": "PreToolUse",
      "matcher": "Task|Agent",
      "env": {
        "TYCON_AUTO_SNAPSHOT": "0"
      },
      "cases": [
        {
          "id": "estampa-repo-y-story-desde-el-marker",
          "type": "must-run",
          "setup": [
            "git init -q -b main . && echo x > a.txt && git add a.txt && git -c user.email=b@b -c user.name=b commit -q -m base",
            "node -e \"const fs=require('fs');const d=process.env.SANDBOX_HOME+'/.claude/.tycon-pipeline/active';fs.mkdirSync(d,{recursive:true});fs.writeFileSync(d+'/bench-led1.json',JSON.stringify({sessionId:'bench-led1',storyId:'9.4',repoPath:process.env.FIXTURE,lastTouch:new Date().toISOString()}))\""
          ],
          "stdin": {
            "session_id": "bench-led1",
            "tool_name": "Task",
            "tool_input": {
              "subagent_type": "tycon-plugin-security-basics",
              "model": "sonnet"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "file_contains": [
              {
                "path": "${SANDBOX_HOME}/.claude/.tycon-pipeline/advisor-runs/bench-led1.jsonl",
                "re": "\"story\":\"9.4\""
              },
              {
                "path": "${SANDBOX_HOME}/.claude/.tycon-pipeline/advisor-runs/bench-led1.jsonl",
                "re": "\"repo\":\"[^\"]*fixture\""
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "estampa-repo-por-raiz-de-git-sin-marker",
          "type": "must-run",
          "setup": [
            "git init -q -b main . && echo x > a.txt && git add a.txt && git -c user.email=b@b -c user.name=b commit -q -m base"
          ],
          "stdin": {
            "session_id": "bench-led2",
            "tool_name": "Task",
            "tool_input": {
              "subagent_type": "tycon-plugin-react-conventions"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "file_contains": [
              {
                "path": "${SANDBOX_HOME}/.claude/.tycon-pipeline/advisor-runs/bench-led2.jsonl",
                "re": "\"repo\":\"[^\"]*fixture\""
              },
              {
                "path": "${SANDBOX_HOME}/.claude/.tycon-pipeline/advisor-runs/bench-led2.jsonl",
                "re": "\"story\":null"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "registra-igual-fuera-de-un-repo-git",
          "type": "must-run",
          "stdin": {
            "session_id": "bench-led3",
            "tool_name": "Task",
            "tool_input": {
              "subagent_type": "tycon-story-validator"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "file_contains": [
              {
                "path": "${SANDBOX_HOME}/.claude/.tycon-pipeline/advisor-runs/bench-led3.jsonl",
                "re": "tycon-story-validator"
              },
              {
                "path": "${SANDBOX_HOME}/.claude/.tycon-pipeline/advisor-runs/bench-led3.jsonl",
                "re": "\"repo\":null"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "la-retrospectiva-estampa-el-repo-y-el-merge-QUE-LE-PIDIERON",
          "type": "must-run",
          "__doc": "2026-08-31: la atribución contesta «¿en qué repo trabaja esta sesión?» — buena para los revisores, MENTIRA para el capturer, que se lanza post-merge y muchas veces con el marker de una story de OTRO repo. Sobre ese dato el freno empareja merge↔retro. El blanco real viaja en el prompt del spawn: acá el marker dice el fixture y el prompt pide otro repo — gana el prompt (en retro_repo/retro_sha, sin pisar repo/story, de los que dependen el roster y el snapshot de iteración).",
          "setup": [
            "git init -q -b main . && echo x > a.txt && git add a.txt && git -c user.email=b@b -c user.name=b commit -q -m base",
            "node -e \"const fs=require('fs');const d=process.env.SANDBOX_HOME+'/.claude/.tycon-pipeline/active';fs.mkdirSync(d,{recursive:true});fs.writeFileSync(d+'/bench-led1.json',JSON.stringify({sessionId:'bench-led1',storyId:'9.4',repoPath:process.env.FIXTURE,lastTouch:new Date().toISOString()}))\""
          ],
          "stdin": {
            "session_id": "bench-led1",
            "tool_name": "Agent",
            "tool_input": {
              "subagent_type": "tycon-retrospective-capturer",
              "model": "sonnet",
              "prompt": "Post-merge retrospective: repo /Users/x/SourceCode/Totora/Backend, merge 86bbbb5ab153 — capturá learnings."
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "file_contains": [
              {
                "path": "${SANDBOX_HOME}/.claude/.tycon-pipeline/advisor-runs/bench-led1.jsonl",
                "re": "\"retro_repo\":\"/Users/x/SourceCode/Totora/Backend\""
              },
              {
                "path": "${SANDBOX_HOME}/.claude/.tycon-pipeline/advisor-runs/bench-led1.jsonl",
                "re": "\"retro_sha\":\"86bbbb5ab153\""
              },
              {
                "path": "${SANDBOX_HOME}/.claude/.tycon-pipeline/advisor-runs/bench-led1.jsonl",
                "re": "\"story\":\"9.4\""
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sin-blanco-en-el-prompt-no-se-inventa-ninguno",
          "type": "must-run",
          "__doc": "Un blanco inventado es peor que ninguno: si el prompt no dice a qué repo/merge apunta la retro, no se estampa nada y el freno cae a su emparejamiento anterior.",
          "setup": [
            "git init -q -b main . && echo x > a.txt && git add a.txt && git -c user.email=b@b -c user.name=b commit -q -m base",
            "node -e \"const fs=require('fs');const d=process.env.SANDBOX_HOME+'/.claude/.tycon-pipeline/active';fs.mkdirSync(d,{recursive:true});fs.writeFileSync(d+'/bench-led1.json',JSON.stringify({sessionId:'bench-led1',storyId:'9.4',repoPath:process.env.FIXTURE,lastTouch:new Date().toISOString()}))\""
          ],
          "stdin": {
            "session_id": "bench-led1",
            "tool_name": "Agent",
            "tool_input": {
              "subagent_type": "tycon-retrospective-capturer",
              "model": "sonnet",
              "prompt": "hacé la retro de lo último que mergeamos"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "file_contains": [
              {
                "path": "${SANDBOX_HOME}/.claude/.tycon-pipeline/advisor-runs/bench-led1.jsonl",
                "re": "tycon-retrospective-capturer"
              }
            ],
            "file_not_contains": [
              {
                "path": "${SANDBOX_HOME}/.claude/.tycon-pipeline/advisor-runs/bench-led1.jsonl",
                "re": "retro_repo"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "el-blanco-se-estampa-SOLO-para-la-retrospectiva",
          "type": "must-run",
          "__doc": "Un revisor cualquiera cuyo prompt mencione un repo y un sha no es una retrospectiva: el campo es del capturer y de nadie más.",
          "setup": [
            "git init -q -b main . && echo x > a.txt && git add a.txt && git -c user.email=b@b -c user.name=b commit -q -m base",
            "node -e \"const fs=require('fs');const d=process.env.SANDBOX_HOME+'/.claude/.tycon-pipeline/active';fs.mkdirSync(d,{recursive:true});fs.writeFileSync(d+'/bench-led1.json',JSON.stringify({sessionId:'bench-led1',storyId:'9.4',repoPath:process.env.FIXTURE,lastTouch:new Date().toISOString()}))\""
          ],
          "stdin": {
            "session_id": "bench-led1",
            "tool_name": "Agent",
            "tool_input": {
              "subagent_type": "tycon-plugin-security-basics",
              "model": "sonnet",
              "prompt": "revisá el repo /Users/x/OtroRepo, merge deadbeef1234"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "file_contains": [
              {
                "path": "${SANDBOX_HOME}/.claude/.tycon-pipeline/advisor-runs/bench-led1.jsonl",
                "re": "tycon-plugin-security-basics"
              }
            ],
            "file_not_contains": [
              {
                "path": "${SANDBOX_HOME}/.claude/.tycon-pipeline/advisor-runs/bench-led1.jsonl",
                "re": "retro_repo"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
